# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .gitignore for charlie MJ - drive-media-downloader
#
# NOTE ON IMAGES: this file intentionally does NOT ignore .png / .jpg / .jpeg
# (or any other image format). Extension icons, screenshots, and the
# Instagram/store promo graphics are meant to be committed to the repo, so
# no image extensions are listed below. Add your own patterns for a specific
# folder if you ever need to (e.g. `screenshots/raw/`) — just avoid a blanket
# `*.png` / `*.jpg` rule.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Node / frontend build output ------------------------------------------
# The frontend/ folder is a React + Vite scaffold. Its installed packages
# and build output are regenerated from package.json, so there's no reason
# to commit them.
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/

# --- npm / yarn / pnpm logs ---------------------------------------------
# Left behind when an install fails; not useful in version control.
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Environment / secrets ---------------------------------------------
# Never commit local environment files — they can hold API keys, tokens,
# or other machine-specific config.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# --- Editor / IDE clutter -----------------------------------------------
# Personal editor settings that shouldn't be forced on other contributors.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- OS-generated files ---------------------------------------------------
# Junk files macOS/Windows create automatically; never intentional content.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Chrome extension packaging output -------------------------------------
# If you use `chrome.exe --pack-extension` or a zip script to build a
# distributable .crx/.pem/.zip, keep the generated artifact out of git —
# it should be rebuilt from source, not tracked.
*.crx
*.pem
/extension.zip
/*.zip

# --- Logs & temp files -------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
.cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicitly NOT ignored (kept here as a reminder, these lines do nothing —
# Git tracks files by default unless a rule above matches them):
#   *.png   -> extension icons, screenshots, promo graphics
#   *.jpg / *.jpeg -> photos, screenshots
#   *.svg   -> any vector assets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
